dhampiros-artwork (0.2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Make the DhampirOS Nocturne look the system default for new users:
    LXQt theme and icon theme, desktop wallpaper, and QTerminal colour scheme
    are shipped as /etc/skel defaults and /usr/share data.
  * Add DhampirNocturne QTerminal colour scheme generated from palette.json.
  * Ship the source-only GRUB theme without wiring it as GRUB_THEME; the
    upstream Kicksecure GRUB drop-in still controls boot theming.
  * Run a static test that every configured theme/asset path exists in the
    payload during the build.
  * Drop the unused @KEYMAP_SHORT@ placeholder from the GRUB theme label.

